Package: RdistNN
Title: Generalized U-Statistics and Conditional Z-Estimation with Pluggable Scores
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Jakob", family = "Juergens", email = "info@jakobjuergens.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Jakob Juergens [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Jakob Juergens <info@jakobjuergens.com>
Description: Fast, extensible framework for generalized U-statistics and Z-estimation
    with a pluggable score (kernel) interface. Uses compiled C++ fast paths when
    available and falls back to batched R evaluation otherwise. Supports complete
    and incomplete subsampling, batched evaluation, and variance estimation via
    delete-1 jackknife.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
